  "steps": [
   "Finely grate the zest of 1 orange into a large bowl and squeeze in its juice. Whisk in the flour, baking powder, sugar, salt, eggs, milk, 150g of the yoghurt and the melted butter until thick and smooth.",
   "Cut the peel and pith from the other oranges, slice into rounds and toss with the strawberries and honey in a small bowl.",
   "Melt a little butter in a large frying pan over a medium heat. Drop in heaped tablespoons of batter, spaced apart. Cook for 2 minutes until bubbles appear, then flip and cook for 1 to 2 minutes more, until golden and risen.",
   "Keep warm under a tea towel while you cook the rest, adding a little butter to the pan as needed.",
